  +2y: 1 point over the starter line = 0.7 KTC value, resale counts 1.28  (cells 48, fit R2 0.78)
  +3y: 1 point over the starter line = 5.7 KTC value, resale counts 1.31  (cells 45, fit R2 0.44)

